        ("Ex2DcSoh",        "Ex2 DC SOH",         "That country's OWN export-warehouse stock: SUM(R1WHSOH) from LPM_Ex2ItemSOH for the (Country, DivCode), split across its stores in proportion to Week Sales (largest-remainder). Falls back to an equal split when the division has no weekly sales. Countries absent from LPM_Ex2LocationConfig — including UAE and OMAN — get 0 here; their DC stock is in the next column."),
